  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Took off",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Missions</strong>, open the mission. Tap <strong>Took off</strong> when the drone is up.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dc6a889e6786d8eb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick the drone track",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the drone's track, or <strong>By hand</strong> when it sends no position.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c80a11ef2855b683.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Move the drone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Move the drone marker with <strong>Draw track</strong> as it flies, and others see it once it is 300 m from you. Tap <strong>Mark finding</strong> when the drone sees something.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6fe5a685a22ebc44.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mark what it sees",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Enemy ›</strong> and pick what the drone sees, here Armour. Then tap <strong>Place</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c6b60ec9d043d5ed.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See the finding",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The mark lands on your map where the drone is. Send it on with <strong>Send to…</strong> as you send any mark.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6f9fce8a9dd3b5f3.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "End the flight",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the flight ends, tap how it ended. After <strong>Expended</strong>, the used drone comes off <strong>Our drones</strong> by itself.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2e74cdf547c5421a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
